Revision history for PayProp-API-Public-Client

1.04 2026-09-11T11:27:59Z

        - Mark distribution as deprecated (x_deprecated). A new PayProp API version is in
          development that will break the authentication flow this module uses, and this
          module is no longer used internally. Fixed a TLS verification CVE; no further
          development is planned.

0.04  2023-12-07 10:06:24 SAST

        - Add `lib/PayProp/API/Public/Client/Request/Tags.pm` functionality.
        - Major changes to how path parameters are provided.
        - Introduce path parameter ordering.
        - Refactoring of tests.

0.03  2023-11-17 02:32:01 SAST

        - Fix documentation formatting and spelling errors.
        - 0.01  2023-11-02 11:54:05 SAST
        - Initial release
